@startuml
title Smart Pet Care - Contract-Level Conceptual Domain Classes

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam wrapWidth 190
left to right direction

class UserProfile <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +email: string
  +displayName: string?
  +phoneNumber: string?
  +termsAccepted: boolean
  +createdAt: date-time
  +updatedAt: date-time?
}

class Pet <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +name: string
  +species: AnimalSpecies
  +breed: string?
  +birthDate: date-time?
  +weightKg: number?
  +sex: Sex
  +photoUrl: string?
  +allergies: string[]?
  +chronicConditions: string[]?
  +behavioralNotes: string[]?
}

class Reminder <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +petId: UUID
  +title: string
  +type: ReminderType
  +status: ReminderStatus
  +repeatType: RepeatType
  +startAt: date-time
  +nextTriggerAt: date-time?
}

class ReminderRun <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +reminderId: UUID
  +scheduledFor: date-time
  +sentAt: date-time?
  +completedAt: date-time?
  +status: ReminderRunStatus
}

class FeedingLog <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +petId: UUID
  +fedAt: date-time
  +foodType: FoodType
  +portionAmount: number?
}

class HealthRecord <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +petId: UUID
  +type: HealthRecordType
  +title: string
  +performedAt: date-time
  +nextDueAt: date-time?
}

class WeightLog <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +id: UUID
  +petId: UUID
  +weightKg: number
  +measuredAt: date-time
}

class AssistantSession <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +sessionId: UUID
  +petId: UUID
  +petType: PetType
  +symptomSummary: string?
  +createdAt: date-time
  +updatedAt: date-time
}

class AssistantMessage <<OpenAPI response>> {
  +messageId: UUID
  +role: ChatMessageRole
  +status: ChatMessageStatus?
  +content: string
  +createdAt: date-time
}

UserProfile "1" .. "0..*" Pet : authorized access\nMULTIPLICITY TO CONFIRM
Pet "1" -- "0..*" Reminder : petId
Reminder "1" -- "0..*" ReminderRun : reminderId
Pet "1" -- "0..*" FeedingLog : petId
Pet "1" -- "0..*" HealthRecord : petId
Pet "1" -- "0..*" WeightLog : petId
Pet "1" -- "0..*" AssistantSession : petId
AssistantSession "1" *-- "0..*" AssistantMessage : response embeds messages

note bottom of UserProfile
  The mobile API is authenticated and exposes
  user/profile operations, but the response DTOs do
  not directly prove the persisted User-Pet relation.
end note

note bottom of AssistantMessage
  This is a conceptual contract model derived from
  docs/openapi.json. It is not a backend database,
  ORM, or storage-schema diagram. Backend owners
  must confirm persistence classes and multiplicities.
end note

@enduml
